---
description: CounterCrave architecture, SEO and affiliate rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read AGENTS.md before writing code.
- Use the documentation bundled in node_modules/next/dist/docs for Next.js APIs.
- Prefer Server Components. A Client Component must have a clear interaction need.
- Never expose unpublished draft content in the production sitemap or robots index.
- Keep canonical URLs in the /slug/ format.
- Generate every Amazon product link through the central affiliate utility.
- The default Amazon Associate tag is visitbest07-20.
- Never scrape Amazon product pages or images.
- Do not hardcode volatile prices or Amazon customer review ratings.
- Do not claim hands-on testing unless the content file contains verified evidence.
- Keep output semantic, accessible and responsive.
